Shared canonical golden fixtures for OpenAI-compatible providers.

These two files (chat_request_001.json / chat_response_001.json) capture the
common wire shape that every OpenAiCompatProvider (and the OpenAI/Azure
providers) round-trips identically. Individual provider test modules load them
via include_str!("../openai_compat/goldens/...") and patch the `model` field
to the provider's expected upstream model id before running the parity
assertion.

Provider-specific goldens that cannot be expressed by patching a single field
(e.g. OpenRouter's injected `usage` block is patched in-test; OpenAI's tools
golden stays at openai/goldens/chat_request_002.json) remain in their own
modules.
